# shell: desktop
# argv: none
# AW-016: a default desktop picture is installed when the desktop carries no
# background yet, at a golden-ratio x and nine tenths of the height.
wait 10
note 1000 x 680: the picture's corner lands at 618, 612, so a point just
note inside it is the picture's own colour rather than the backdrop
expect-pixel 640 620 10c810
note and the backdrop is untouched where the picture is not
expect-pixel 100 600 336698
quit
